CROSS-METHOD CONCORDANCE — per-cluster TMdiff_centered sign agreement
======================================================================
Independent of diversity-call thresholds: even if no single method
crosses its own delta, sign-agreement across orthogonal methods
(different training sets / inductive biases) is hard to dismiss
as method-specific bias. ~50% = chance; >70% = significant.

